        "body": "Integrate Navigation 3 deep linking.\r\n\r\n- Updated Navigation 3 library to 1.2.0 (with compileSdk 37 and minSdk 24) to support the Navigation 3 deep link APIs.\r\n\r\n- Converted ForYouNavKey into a data class with an optional linkedNewsResourceId parameter, match incoming deep link intents in MainActivity using UriDeepLinkMatcher, and pass the matched key through rememberNiaAppState and rememberNavigationState to initialize the starting sub-stack.\r\n\r\n- Passed ForYouNavKey to ForYouViewModel via assisted injection so deepLinkedNewsResource is initialized from the navigation key.\r\n\r\n- Added NavigationState.isAtTopLevel to keep the top app bar visible and handle back navigation when the root of a sub-stack is a deep link key.",
